Package: m3eReplication
Type: Package
Title: Replication of the Static and Dynamic Three-Equation Macroeconomic Model
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Replication", "Package", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "replication@example.invalid")
Description: Reproduces the coefficient matrices, equilibria, dynamic simulations,
    impulse responses and charts of the supplied static and dynamic M3E Excel
    workbooks. The package also exposes an affine state-space representation of
    the dynamic model.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
LazyData: false

